    "6": {
      "note": "An admitted leaf receives its own rendered document plus declared requirement files at repository-task-relative paths, deduplicated from local Markdown links/typed references. It does not copy master/sprint/reference baggage. INDEX records copied digests and missing requirement rows; missing sources are named without failing launch solely for absence. Refresh resolves the bound own leaf using artifact identity or the safe leaf_id/task_root binding, recomputes the leaf-plus-requirements set, reclaims obsolete copies and includes deletions in rollback. Foreign/unrecognized contracts still fail closed. Per-file/aggregate copy and rollback budgets and bounded status reconciliation remain explicit; large-file size/time comparison is not a universal hash witness. Copies are outside Git and never replace canonical authority.",
      "targets": [
        {
